@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title Security Plane 组件图
left to right direction

rectangle "KernelHost / Backend\n策略与身份权威源" as HOST LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "L1 PEP / L3 ExecutionGuard" as PEP_CALLERS LC_EXTERNAL
package "Security Plane" LC_DANGER {
  component "PermissionDecisionEngine\nPDP" as PDP
  component "ExecutionPermit" as PERMIT
  component "PEP Enforcement" as PEP
  component "ApprovalBridge" as APPROVAL
  database "Compiled Policy Snapshot" as POLICY
}
rectangle "业务审批边界" as BUSINESS LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "Security Repository Port" as INFRA LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
rectangle "Security Audit" as OPS LC_OPERATIONS

HOST --> POLICY : PolicySnapshotPort
PEP_CALLERS --> PEP : BND-SEC-001
PEP --> PDP : PermissionDecisionPort
PDP --> POLICY : 只读策略快照
PDP --> PERMIT : Allow / Ask / Deny
PERMIT --> APPROVAL : Ask
APPROVAL --> BUSINESS : ApprovalRequestPort
BUSINESS ..> APPROVAL : ApprovalDecisionPort
PERMIT --> INFRA : PermitRepositoryPort
PDP ..> OPS : BND-OPS-001

note bottom of POLICY
  Kernel 不认证用户，也不拥有 RBAC/ABAC；
  这里只保存已编译、带版本的技术策略快照。
end note
@enduml
